  <p id="c-nanqishu-003-zixiang-ann:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">八年春正月庚子</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-003-zixiang-ann:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">八月丙寅</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-003-zixiang-ann:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">壬辰，以左衞將軍隨郡王<persName id="c-nanqishu-003-zixiang-ann:p003:m0011" ref="4tg_ud8_zdy">子隆</persName>為荊州刺史。巴東王<persName id="c-nanqishu-003-zixiang-ann:p003:m0022" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>有罪，遣丹陽尹<persName id="c-nanqishu-003-zixiang-ann:p003:m0031" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_A">蕭順之</persName>率軍討之，<persName id="c-nanqishu-003-zixiang-ann:p003:m0039" ref="kix_r92_2ed_G">子響</persName>伏誅。</p>
</text>
